faqsText:
Is Faisal Town Phase 1 in F-18? | Yes. Faisal Town Phase 1 is commonly associated with Sector F-18 Islamabad and the Rawalpindi-Kohat / Fateh Jang Road area.

Which blocks are in Faisal Town Phase 1? | Current Phase 1 material lists Block A, Block B, Block B-1 and Block C. :contentReference[oaicite:9]{index=9}

Are Blocks A, B and C developed? | Current Phase 1 project material describes Blocks A, B and C as established or developed areas. Property-level possession and utilities should still be verified before purchase. :contentReference[oaicite:10]{index=10}

What is Block B-1? | Block B-1 is a newer Phase 1 block. Current project-focused sources list smaller residential categories and indicate that its status should be checked separately from the established A/B/C blocks. :contentReference[oaicite:11]{index=11}

What plot sizes are available in Faisal Town Phase 1? | Common residential categories range from approximately 5 marla to 1 kanal, but availability differs by block.

Are plots available for sale in Faisal Town Phase 1? | Yes. Current property portals show active resale inventory across Blocks A, B and C. :contentReference[oaicite:12]{index=12}

Are houses available in Faisal Town Phase 1? | Yes. Phase 1 has an established house-sale and rental market in addition to residential plots.

Which Faisal Town Phase 1 block is best? | There is no single best block for every buyer. Compare the exact property, price, street, access, possession, dues and intended use.

Is Faisal Town Phase 1 the same as Phase 2? | No. Phase 1 is the older block-based F-18 project, while Phase 2 / FT-II is a separate sector-based development.

Should I verify approval or NOC status before buying? | Yes. Regulatory status should be checked independently with the relevant authority, especially for newer additions or extensions. RDA itself advises buyers to verify current housing-scheme status directly rather than relying on screenshots or marketing claims. :contentReference[oaicite:13]{index=13}
